: "So sing with me this funky tune,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Forget the rules, let\u2019s all be a little kooky soon."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "The ugly becomes cool, yeah, it\u2019s true,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "In this quirky song, we find beauty too."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}